<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-437] Autoscroll misbehaving when paragraph status is changing</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-437</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After improvement of Autoscroll &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-401&quot; title=&quot;Autoscroll on key up/down to wrong position of the document&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-401&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-401&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Autoscroll is triggered when focused paragraph status is changing.&lt;br/&gt;
Which should not trigger (except for last paragraph executed and new paragraph inserted).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
