                            <comment id="15010914" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 18 Nov 2015 12:49:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user Leemoonsoo opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/445&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/445&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-437&quot; title=&quot;Autoscroll misbehaving when paragraph status is changing&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-437&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-437&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Improvement Autoscroll&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-437&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-437&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This PR changes&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Autoscroll to cursor on paragraph status change, only when cursor is on the last paragraph (to tail the notebook)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;When tail the notebook, waits for sometime to output is rendered and then fire autoscroll event.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


